(5239158, 762624, 52472, '<td valign="top">The pose of the left hand is not very elegant (hidden thumb, chubby fingers). The right pose is good, but the contrast and sharpness is a bit unfortunate (like dirty finger nails). The composition would maybe be improved if less of the arms were shown.<br/>But as you see, I studied this picture for a long while, which means that it is excellent!</td>', 'The pose of the left hand is not very elegant (hidden thumb, chubby fingers). The right pose is good, but the contrast and sharpness is a bit unfortunate (like dirty finger nails). The composition would maybe be improved if less of the arms were shown.But as you see, I studied this picture for a long while, which means that it is excellent!', '2009-02-04 12:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
