(5239205, 762488, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice overall shape, but lighting is a bit flat.</td>', 'Nice overall shape, but lighting is a bit flat.', '2009-02-04 12:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239209, 762533, 52472, '<td valign="top">It seems to be in good working order, not like Microsoft at all ;-) Therefore, I would have gone for a shiny ironic advertisement lighting, instead of your gloomy approach.</td>', 'It seems to be in good working order, not like Microsoft at all ;-) Therefore, I would have gone for a shiny ironic advertisement lighting, instead of your gloomy approach.', '2009-02-04 12:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239211, 760894, 103411, '<td valign="top">He''s sweating because he hears the butter crackling in the pan!</td>', 'He''s sweating because he hears the butter crackling in the pan!', '2009-02-04 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239215, 762430, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful still-life. The tall twig adds dimension. I really sat and analyzed this because the illusion is so good.  The feathers could ALMOST be a hungry chirping hatchling, and the almost undetectable shadow of the twig gave away the cloud background :-)</td>', 'Wonderful still-life. The tall twig adds dimension. I really sat and analyzed this because the illusion is so good.  The feathers could ALMOST be a hungry chirping hatchling, and the almost undetectable shadow of the twig gave away the cloud background :-)', '2009-02-04 12:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239219, 762661, 96751, '<td valign="top">This reminds me a trip I took to Yosemite...  Not sure it really shows the beginning (or even the end) of the day - the lighting is too even.</td>', 'This reminds me a trip I took to Yosemite...  Not sure it really shows the beginning (or even the end) of the day - the lighting is too even.', '2009-02-04 12:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239223, 762505, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, even though it doesn''t say Begin to me.  I think I hear it saying "Fargo" though...  :-)</td>', 'Love the shot, even though it doesn''t say Begin to me.  I think I hear it saying "Fargo" though...  :-)', '2009-02-04 12:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239228, 762412, 52472, '<td valign="top">Not exceedingly sharp nor original - a good picture nevertheless.</td>', 'Not exceedingly sharp nor original - a good picture nevertheless.', '2009-02-04 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239230, 762161, 103411, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, 7.</td>', 'Cute idea, 7.', '2009-02-04 13:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239231, 760903, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the pov and the symmetry of this shot.  Just feel it''s a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Love the pov and the symmetry of this shot.  Just feel it''s a bit out of focus.', '2009-02-04 13:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239233, 761957, 103411, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the match.</td>', 'Love the texture of the match.', '2009-02-04 13:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239234, 762530, 96751, '<td valign="top">great dof; wish the lighting had mirrored it, fading off into the back.</td>', 'great dof; wish the lighting had mirrored it, fading off into the back.', '2009-02-04 13:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239236, 762279, 103411, '<td valign="top">I remember those days!  Mmmm, calculus.</td>', 'I remember those days!  Mmmm, calculus.', '2009-02-04 13:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239238, 762329, 103411, '<td valign="top">Arizona should have won!</td>', 'Arizona should have won!', '2009-02-04 13:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239239, 761218, 96751, '<td valign="top">An evocative shot; the use of tilt, desat, pov, all make an impact, but along with the expression on the girl, the mood is more mystery or fear or apprehension than beginning.</td>', 'An evocative shot; the use of tilt, desat, pov, all make an impact, but along with the expression on the girl, the mood is more mystery or fear or apprehension than beginning.', '2009-02-04 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239241, 760508, 96751, '<td valign="top">How cute is this!  Although I love the content, the shot looks more like a snapshot than a challenge photograph.  Lack of isolation on the subject, flat lighting, distracting elements in the background and foreground.</td>', 'How cute is this!  Although I love the content, the shot looks more like a snapshot than a challenge photograph.  Lack of isolation on the subject, flat lighting, distracting elements in the background and foreground.', '2009-02-04 13:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239245, 761957, 52472, '<td valign="top">I truly never saw such an ugly match in my life, you must be short of timber in your region ;-) It''s quite a contrast to the smooth and nicely coloured flame and smoke. I bet you were tempted to clone out the flying ash bits...</td>', 'I truly never saw such an ugly match in my life, you must be short of timber in your region ;-) It''s quite a contrast to the smooth and nicely coloured flame and smoke. I bet you were tempted to clone out the flying ash bits...', '2009-02-04 13:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239253, 761250, 52472, '<td valign="top">The chaotic straw dominates this picture too much, mainly because of the big highlight and the unsharp foreground.</td>', 'The chaotic straw dominates this picture too much, mainly because of the big highlight and the unsharp foreground.', '2009-02-04 13:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239265, 762505, 52472, '<td valign="top">Brilliant exposure. The focus is on the part of the fence which escapes from the view. This is quite difficult for the eye, but interesting. The notion of walking is not clear at all in the picture.</td>', 'Brilliant exposure. The focus is on the part of the fence which escapes from the view. This is quite difficult for the eye, but interesting. The notion of walking is not clear at all in the picture.', '2009-02-04 13:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239269, 762092, 52472, '<td valign="top">The main problem is that you cannot really see what you are referring to, I guess it''s some kind of barrels. In the context of pollution, the harsh colours are a creative idea, but some voters might get a conjunctivitis.</td>', 'The main problem is that you cannot really see what you are referring to, I guess it''s some kind of barrels. In the context of pollution, the harsh colours are a creative idea, but some voters might get a conjunctivitis.', '2009-02-04 13:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239276, 762599, 96751, '<td valign="top">the detail on this is terrific.  The muted pink works great with the skin tones and the shiny silver.  The top crop is just a tish tight for me.</td>', 'the detail on this is terrific.  The muted pink works great with the skin tones and the shiny silver.  The top crop is just a tish tight for me.', '2009-02-04 13:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239279, 762584, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture!  Incredible color and sharpness.  Love the splayed wing at the top.</td>', 'Fabulous capture!  Incredible color and sharpness.  Love the splayed wing at the top.', '2009-02-04 13:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239281, 761873, 103411, '<td valign="top">Five dollar footlong!</td>', 'Five dollar footlong!', '2009-02-04 13:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239299, 762284, 98537, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting..</td>', 'Neat lighting..', '2009-02-04 13:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239326, 760528, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love ferns.  Interesting idea.  Needs a bit more contrast or lighting.</td>', 'I love ferns.  Interesting idea.  Needs a bit more contrast or lighting.', '2009-02-04 14:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239327, 762083, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ok, so because I actually do calligraphy, I''m picky.  Great idea, but you really should have used a nib pen....</td>', 'Ok, so because I actually do calligraphy, I''m picky.  Great idea, but you really should have used a nib pen....', '2009-02-04 14:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239333, 762377, 96751, '<td valign="top">Most technical egg rendition.  Fun shot.  Architectural ova :-)</td>', 'Most technical egg rendition.  Fun shot.  Architectural ova :-)', '2009-02-04 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239334, 762329, 88501, '<td valign="top">or a season finale... how did you enter in both challenges?</td>', 'or a season finale... how did you enter in both challenges?', '2009-02-04 14:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239335, 762664, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very graceful, nice lighting and colors.  Doesn''t look focused as much as sharpened.</td>', 'Very graceful, nice lighting and colors.  Doesn''t look focused as much as sharpened.', '2009-02-04 14:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239337, 761332, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  I''d have desatured the background to make the lettering more prominent.</td>', 'Interesting picture.  I''d have desatured the background to make the lettering more prominent.', '2009-02-04 14:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239340, 762583, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the monochrome on this.  The sky and ship look great, but the see is oddly dark.  There''s no sparkling, so it''s kind of flat.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the monochrome on this.  The sky and ship look great, but the see is oddly dark.  There''s no sparkling, so it''s kind of flat.', '2009-02-04 14:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239341, 761080, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is breathtaking.  Not sure how it meets the challenge, but it''s a stunning shot.</td>', 'This is breathtaking.  Not sure how it meets the challenge, but it''s a stunning shot.', '2009-02-04 14:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239342, 762161, 96751, '<td valign="top">One of the more imaginative egg shots.  The lighting on the egg is a bit blow out on the right edges (especially the cap), and for all the trouble you went to, the bird images could have been more bird-like.</td>', 'One of the more imaginative egg shots.  The lighting on the egg is a bit blow out on the right edges (especially the cap), and for all the trouble you went to, the bird images could have been more bird-like.', '2009-02-04 14:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239343, 762203, 96751, '<td valign="top">The gray background really shows off the pink on this.  Back lighting gives dimension and highlights translucence.  Nice shapes too.</td>', 'The gray background really shows off the pink on this.  Back lighting gives dimension and highlights translucence.  Nice shapes too.', '2009-02-04 14:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239344, 761873, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Great idea.  Lighting is a bit harsh, and the angle a bit weird.</td>', 'LOL!  Great idea.  Lighting is a bit harsh, and the angle a bit weird.', '2009-02-04 14:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239345, 762679, 96751, '<td valign="top">ZOMG!!! PONIES!  But seriously, nice composition and subjects.  I feel you could have tweeked the lighting a bit to bring out the horsies.</td>', 'ZOMG!!! PONIES!  But seriously, nice composition and subjects.  I feel you could have tweeked the lighting a bit to bring out the horsies.', '2009-02-04 14:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239347, 760951, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yeah sure.  I''ll be over for breakfast in a minute!  Yum.</td>', 'Yeah sure.  I''ll be over for breakfast in a minute!  Yum.', '2009-02-04 14:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239351, 762412, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...  This shot has the opposite issues that the other match shot does.  It''s a bit dark, and the flame is oddly dull.  I wish you had used a different colored match head for more contrast, but the lighting on the stick is good.</td>', 'Hmmmm...  This shot has the opposite issues that the other match shot does.  It''s a bit dark, and the flame is oddly dull.  I wish you had used a different colored match head for more contrast, but the lighting on the stick is good.', '2009-02-04 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239352, 762624, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice studio shot.  But what''s with the uneven nails?????  The PP effect is very interesting.  Would love to know how you did it.</td>', 'Nice studio shot.  But what''s with the uneven nails?????  The PP effect is very interesting.  Would love to know how you did it.', '2009-02-04 14:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239353, 761957, 96751, '<td valign="top">Best lighting on the match of the matchsticks so far.  Don''t know why the flame looks like it''s behind the match head, although it has wonderful colors.  Also, the spots surrounding the flame are really distracting, looking more like dust and noise than any throwoff from the combustion.</td>', 'Best lighting on the match of the matchsticks so far.  Don''t know why the flame looks like it''s behind the match head, although it has wonderful colors.  Also, the spots surrounding the flame are really distracting, looking more like dust and noise than any throwoff from the combustion.', '2009-02-04 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239356, 762407, 96751, '<td valign="top">wonderful dof and great focus on the eyes.  I think this might have worked better in color.</td>', 'wonderful dof and great focus on the eyes.  I think this might have worked better in color.', '2009-02-04 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239360, 761247, 96751, '<td valign="top">Magnificent shot.  If voters are into landscapes for this challenge, this should place in the top 10.  Wonderful thirds, opposites (soft clouds, hard pier), shapes (opposing triangle-like shapes in the clouds and pier), and the perfectly counterpointed sun and person.  Superbly done.  The only detraction for me are the reflected light specks on the pier below the sun.  Although the color works, and it helps define the edge, they look added, or fake somehow.</td>', 'Magnificent shot.  If voters are into landscapes for this challenge, this should place in the top 10.  Wonderful thirds, opposites (soft clouds, hard pier), shapes (opposing triangle-like shapes in the clouds and pier), and the perfectly counterpointed sun and person.  Superbly done.  The only detraction for me are the reflected light specks on the pier below the sun.  Although the color works, and it helps define the edge, they look added, or fake somehow.', '2009-02-04 14:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239431, 762377, 100227, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Love hand drawn plans/old tools.</td>', 'Very cool.  Love hand drawn plans/old tools.', '2009-02-04 15:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239434, 762596, 100227, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Very original, although a bit blurry.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Very original, although a bit blurry.', '2009-02-04 15:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239435, 762161, 100227, '<td valign="top">Excellent twist!  I love it!</td>', 'Excellent twist!  I love it!', '2009-02-04 15:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239437, 762584, 100227, '<td valign="top">Love the angle!</td>', 'Love the angle!', '2009-02-04 15:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239471, 762203, 80878, '<td valign="top">You guys have spring already! Man Im jealous its still ice age here at -13 F</td>', 'You guys have spring already! Man Im jealous its still ice age here at -13 F', '2009-02-04 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239474, 762150, 103483, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting for the picture!</td>', 'Nice lighting for the picture!', '2009-02-04 15:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239477, 762596, 80878, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2009-02-04 15:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239501, 762073, 51031, '<td valign="top">...and mine.</td>', '...and mine.', '2009-02-04 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239524, 760536, 94601, '<td valign="top">The expression on the back turtle is fantastic.  It''s a nice shot- I really like how monotone the colors are but also how defined the turtles are.</td>', 'The expression on the back turtle is fantastic.  It''s a nice shot- I really like how monotone the colors are but also how defined the turtles are.', '2009-02-04 16:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239530, 762424, 94601, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Good thinking keeping "brew" in focus with the on/off- that and the out of focus mug help put the photo in context really well.  The border feels a bit heavy too me- just because outside of the lit button, the next dominant element of your photo is the border.  Overall nice concept and nice shot.<br/> <br/>I have a coffee grinder/brewer with an auto start clock- love that thing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Good thinking keeping "brew" in focus with the on/off- that and the out of focus mug help put the photo in context really well.  The border feels a bit heavy too me- just because outside of the lit button, the next dominant element of your photo is the border.  Overall nice concept and nice shot. I have a coffee grinder/brewer with an auto start clock- love that thing.', '2009-02-04 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239535, 762665, 94601, '<td valign="top">hmm... interesting.    I like the idea with the puzzle... there''s a bit too much dead space for me- the bottom corners are ok, but when you add those with the space between the connected pieces and the stack of untouched, it''s a bit too much in my opinion.  I think the spacing could have worked well as is from a lower angle- would reduce the space between the pieces... either that, or put more unused pieces closer from the current angle.<br/> <br/>Just my opinion though- well lit and exposed shot-  The pieces themselves are well captured.</td>', 'hmm... interesting.    I like the idea with the puzzle... there''s a bit too much dead space for me- the bottom corners are ok, but when you add those with the space between the connected pieces and the stack of untouched, it''s a bit too much in my opinion.  I think the spacing could have worked well as is from a lower angle- would reduce the space between the pieces... either that, or put more unused pieces closer from the current angle. Just my opinion though- well lit and exposed shot-  The pieces themselves are well captured.', '2009-02-04 16:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239552, 762407, 67145, '<td valign="top">excellent ..!!</td>', 'excellent ..!!', '2009-02-04 16:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239586, 762686, 103350, '<td valign="top">This is the only entry that gave me an inclination to "start" something.  Way to think outside the box.</td>', 'This is the only entry that gave me an inclination to "start" something.  Way to think outside the box.', '2009-02-04 17:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239589, 762279, 103350, '<td valign="top">I like how you thought outside the box.</td>', 'I like how you thought outside the box.', '2009-02-04 17:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
