(5240111, 761871, 102513, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, I gave it a 8.  I would have given it a 9 if you had a cat in the tree... or maybe a cat dressed like a hiker... but there are no cats in the photo anywhere!</td>', 'Nice pic, I gave it a 8.  I would have given it a 9 if you had a cat in the tree... or maybe a cat dressed like a hiker... but there are no cats in the photo anywhere!', '2009-02-04 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5240134, 762067, 77521, '<td valign="top">things i like: i like the depth of field in this, the simplicity also, i like the negative space.<br/>things i would change. it seems the the text is a little uneven, you could have straightened that out in photoshop. also i would have liked to have seen this in black and white and maybe added a bit of contrast to add some more interest to the shot. 5</td>', 'things i like: i like the depth of field in this, the simplicity also, i like the negative space.things i would change. it seems the the text is a little uneven, you could have straightened that out in photoshop. also i would have liked to have seen this in black and white and maybe added a bit of contrast to add some more interest to the shot. 5', '2009-02-05 00:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5240136, 762435, 77521, '<td valign="top">nice shot! love the background, it really  makes the shot POP! 7</td>', 'nice shot! love the background, it really  makes the shot POP! 7', '2009-02-05 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5240326, 760528, 88718, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject but perhaps cropped too close</td>', 'Very nice subject but perhaps cropped too close', '2009-02-05 04:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
