(5243468, 762150, 52472, '<td valign="top">You like weak coffee, it seems :)<br/>I love your lighting, it gives some wonderful contrast and shapes. The drop is a bit insignificant (compare to a Nespresso advertisement). So maybe it would be better without drop and maybe some steam to make it perfect.</td>', 'You like weak coffee, it seems :)I love your lighting, it gives some wonderful contrast and shapes. The drop is a bit insignificant (compare to a Nespresso advertisement). So maybe it would be better without drop and maybe some steam to make it perfect.', '2009-02-07 07:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243470, 762639, 52472, '<td valign="top">It has a very good morning mood, no doubt. I would prefer if one of the persons would stand out a little more and be the subject.</td>', 'It has a very good morning mood, no doubt. I would prefer if one of the persons would stand out a little more and be the subject.', '2009-02-07 07:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243472, 761873, 52472, '<td valign="top">The pose is a bit artificial and the colours look quite toxic. Yet I envy him for this fantastic sandwich which makes it a good advertisement shot.</td>', 'The pose is a bit artificial and the colours look quite toxic. Yet I envy him for this fantastic sandwich which makes it a good advertisement shot.', '2009-02-07 07:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243513, 762354, 100155, '<td valign="top">love this photo, esp. the warm orange in the background.</td>', 'love this photo, esp. the warm orange in the background.', '2009-02-07 09:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243514, 760879, 100155, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait</td>', 'beautiful portrait', '2009-02-07 09:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243516, 762430, 100155, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2009-02-07 09:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243518, 762664, 100155, '<td valign="top">amazing detail</td>', 'amazing detail', '2009-02-07 09:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243553, 762556, 52472, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what it is, therefore I''m not very inspired</td>', 'I have no idea what it is, therefore I''m not very inspired', '2009-02-07 10:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243555, 762204, 52472, '<td valign="top">Somehow it''s hard to believe that a long journey is starting here with this outfit. Still it''s an interesting angle of view and a dynamic picture</td>', 'Somehow it''s hard to believe that a long journey is starting here with this outfit. Still it''s an interesting angle of view and a dynamic picture', '2009-02-07 10:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243573, 762430, 52472, '<td valign="top">Classical still life. A bit too fake for my taste, but well done.</td>', 'Classical still life. A bit too fake for my taste, but well done.', '2009-02-07 11:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243578, 761963, 52472, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colourful reflections. A bit shoehorned into this challenge, but worth it.</td>', 'Fantastic colourful reflections. A bit shoehorned into this challenge, but worth it.', '2009-02-07 11:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243580, 761781, 52472, '<td valign="top">You are seriously looking for some dnmc votes here. On the other hand, the title is really cool, and of course it''s a brilliant macro.</td>', 'You are seriously looking for some dnmc votes here. On the other hand, the title is really cool, and of course it''s a brilliant macro.', '2009-02-07 11:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243592, 762493, 52472, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have used a shorter lense to include more of the landscape. Nevertheless this shot tells us a story, which is important in this challenge. Nice!</td>', 'Personally I would have used a shorter lense to include more of the landscape. Nevertheless this shot tells us a story, which is important in this challenge. Nice!', '2009-02-07 11:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243612, 760545, 52472, '<td valign="top">Artistic use of blur and noise, the filigree branches look great this way. IMO you would be a better painter than photographer ;-)</td>', 'Artistic use of blur and noise, the filigree branches look great this way. IMO you would be a better painter than photographer ;-)', '2009-02-07 11:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243618, 761871, 52472, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have done a good processing job out of a difficult lighting situation. Would it be better with the camera clother to the floor? (It looks kind of remote)</td>', 'Looks like you have done a good processing job out of a difficult lighting situation. Would it be better with the camera clother to the floor? (It looks kind of remote)', '2009-02-07 11:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243622, 762112, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great choice of focus combined with a very effective composition.</td>', 'Great choice of focus combined with a very effective composition.', '2009-02-07 11:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243623, 761890, 52472, '<td valign="top">Maybe if you were lying on the ground with a shorter lense...</td>', 'Maybe if you were lying on the ground with a shorter lense...', '2009-02-07 11:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243626, 760579, 52472, '<td valign="top">How what begins? That''s not a criticism, I''m just being thick. Nice use of DOF</td>', 'How what begins? That''s not a criticism, I''m just being thick. Nice use of DOF', '2009-02-07 11:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243628, 762329, 3102, '<td valign="top">Maybe I bumped into you while taking my "end" photo!  :)  I hope you were also rooting for the Steelers!</td>', 'Maybe I bumped into you while taking my "end" photo!  :)  I hope you were also rooting for the Steelers!', '2009-02-07 11:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243630, 762686, 52472, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF and interesting lighting (nice highlights). Whithout the cardboard playing field it could be a winner.</td>', 'Perfect DOF and interesting lighting (nice highlights). Whithout the cardboard playing field it could be a winner.', '2009-02-07 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243631, 761419, 5364, '<td valign="top">I certainly appreciate the idea, but it needs a more interesting composition - having the cow looking at the camera for instance.</td>', 'I certainly appreciate the idea, but it needs a more interesting composition - having the cow looking at the camera for instance.', '2009-02-07 11:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243632, 762435, 52472, '<td valign="top">Not the most exciting subject/compositon, but a perfectly executed macro!</td>', 'Not the most exciting subject/compositon, but a perfectly executed macro!', '2009-02-07 11:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243635, 761332, 52472, '<td valign="top">Very ironic - perfectly executed. Brilliant!</td>', 'Very ironic - perfectly executed. Brilliant!', '2009-02-07 11:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243638, 762284, 52472, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy (over-sharpened?). Solid composition.</td>', 'A bit grainy (over-sharpened?). Solid composition.', '2009-02-07 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243644, 762534, 52472, '<td valign="top">Very noisy. Except the frame :)<br/>But my wife likes it, she saved you from a bad vote...</td>', 'Very noisy. Except the frame :)But my wife likes it, she saved you from a bad vote...', '2009-02-07 12:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243649, 762532, 52472, '<td valign="top">Well done and very tempting! If it was not dark yet, I would  go straight for a jogging in the forest.</td>', 'Well done and very tempting! If it was not dark yet, I would  go straight for a jogging in the forest.', '2009-02-07 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243653, 762586, 5364, '<td valign="top">Good idea for a subject but because of the angle you''ve photographed this growth, it all looks very flat and uninteresting.</td>', 'Good idea for a subject but because of the angle you''ve photographed this growth, it all looks very flat and uninteresting.', '2009-02-07 12:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243654, 761272, 47729, '<td valign="top">This is a great attempt but it''s just not as sharp as as I''d like to see. It''s also a tad dull.</td>', 'This is a great attempt but it''s just not as sharp as as I''d like to see. It''s also a tad dull.', '2009-02-07 12:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243657, 762624, 5364, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the colour of the skin looks very unnatural and the unmatched finger-nails are a bit distracting</td>', 'Nice idea, but the colour of the skin looks very unnatural and the unmatched finger-nails are a bit distracting', '2009-02-07 12:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243661, 762605, 5364, '<td valign="top">Attractive scene, but you''ve could have used the full 640 pixels for greater impact</td>', 'Attractive scene, but you''ve could have used the full 640 pixels for greater impact', '2009-02-07 12:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243677, 762653, 52472, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the displayed cooking skills... The photography skills on the other hand are certainly there!</td>', 'Not sure about the displayed cooking skills... The photography skills on the other hand are certainly there!', '2009-02-07 12:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243748, 761080, 52472, '<td valign="top">Very nice and mysterious landscape, well done. Is this the <i>beginning</i> of a ski-run?</td>', 'Very nice and mysterious landscape, well done. Is this the beginning of a ski-run?', '2009-02-07 13:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243820, 762391, 52472, '<td valign="top">The composition, lighting, focus are brilliant. I''m always amazed how a great picture can turn out of a very boring subject.</td>', 'The composition, lighting, focus are brilliant. I''m always amazed how a great picture can turn out of a very boring subject.', '2009-02-07 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243824, 762661, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great mood in this picture! Congratulations on getting this perfect lighting.</td>', 'Great mood in this picture! Congratulations on getting this perfect lighting.', '2009-02-07 14:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5243827, 762115, 52472, '<td valign="top">A bit shoehorned into this challenge, but worth it. I like the high contrast.</td>', 'A bit shoehorned into this challenge, but worth it. I like the high contrast.', '2009-02-07 14:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244342, 761963, 64929, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!  The colors are amazing! *10*</td>', 'Magnificent!  The colors are amazing! *10*', '2009-02-07 20:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244346, 762360, 64929, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!  I love the colors! *8*</td>', 'Beautiful!!  I love the colors! *8*', '2009-02-07 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244384, 762377, 45631, '<td valign="top">This would have to be the blue ribbon for sure.  Such a clever idea.  You are very creative.  Well done.</td>', 'This would have to be the blue ribbon for sure.  Such a clever idea.  You are very creative.  Well done.', '2009-02-07 21:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244385, 762621, 45631, '<td valign="top">It always amazes me what different idea people come up with.  This is very clever.  Well done.</td>', 'It always amazes me what different idea people come up with.  This is very clever.  Well done.', '2009-02-07 21:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244389, 762665, 45631, '<td valign="top">Another great idea for this challenge - well done.</td>', 'Another great idea for this challenge - well done.', '2009-02-07 21:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244392, 762578, 45631, '<td valign="top">Simple to the point and meets the challenge.  Love the composition, well done.</td>', 'Simple to the point and meets the challenge.  Love the composition, well done.', '2009-02-07 21:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244565, 761272, 103375, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal composition. Extremely clear. Awesome attention to detail. Point of Focus is "textbook" and precise. Dynamic Range of the flower is somewhat blown out such that there is little detail in the flower behind and slightly above the bug. Very impressive!!</td>', 'Phenomenal composition. Extremely clear. Awesome attention to detail. Point of Focus is "textbook" and precise. Dynamic Range of the flower is somewhat blown out such that there is little detail in the flower behind and slightly above the bug. Very impressive!!', '2009-02-07 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244589, 762284, 103375, '<td valign="top">was the High ISO effect intentional?</td>', 'was the High ISO effect intentional?', '2009-02-08 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244592, 762279, 103375, '<td valign="top">fits the description but little photographic value</td>', 'fits the description but little photographic value', '2009-02-08 00:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244597, 762664, 103375, '<td valign="top">Composition is Great. Dynamic Range is Superb. Fantastic Attention to detail!</td>', 'Composition is Great. Dynamic Range is Superb. Fantastic Attention to detail!', '2009-02-08 00:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244599, 762438, 103375, '<td valign="top">Dynamic Range got blown out. Interesting composition and photography, just fix the blown out highlights.</td>', 'Dynamic Range got blown out. Interesting composition and photography, just fix the blown out highlights.', '2009-02-08 00:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244603, 761681, 103375, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Spectacular color and point of focus. Depth of Field is too shallow. Tighten down your aperture a little to bring the entire bud into clear focus but still blur the leaf and the background.</td>', 'Nice composition. Spectacular color and point of focus. Depth of Field is too shallow. Tighten down your aperture a little to bring the entire bud into clear focus but still blur the leaf and the background.', '2009-02-08 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244606, 760827, 103375, '<td valign="top">interesting composition. Lacks definition. Doesn''t tell the whole story. minimal use of the color spectrum.</td>', 'interesting composition. Lacks definition. Doesn''t tell the whole story. minimal use of the color spectrum.', '2009-02-08 00:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244610, 762640, 103375, '<td valign="top">Nice Composition. Interesting effect.</td>', 'Nice Composition. Interesting effect.', '2009-02-08 00:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244615, 761963, 103375, '<td valign="top">While this is a little bit of a stretch in the categorical restriction of "beginning", I enjoy the reflection of the lights. Well done! Shooting at your light source is a tough skill to be mastered. You have done this well.</td>', 'While this is a little bit of a stretch in the categorical restriction of "beginning", I enjoy the reflection of the lights. Well done! Shooting at your light source is a tough skill to be mastered. You have done this well.', '2009-02-08 00:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244621, 762075, 103375, '<td valign="top">its an egg..... composition is non-existent. detail is merely what is in the surface of the egg. Nothing surrounding to make this interesting except a black background. Great for a product shot where the backdrop is expected to be removed.</td>', 'its an egg..... composition is non-existent. detail is merely what is in the surface of the egg. Nothing surrounding to make this interesting except a black background. Great for a product shot where the backdrop is expected to be removed.', '2009-02-08 00:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244624, 762150, 103375, '<td valign="top">nice composition and timing. Dynamic range could be improved. Nice shot</td>', 'nice composition and timing. Dynamic range could be improved. Nice shot', '2009-02-08 00:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244630, 762413, 103375, '<td valign="top">Dynamic range is an issue - especially for the guy in the foreground. Nice compositio.</td>', 'Dynamic range is an issue - especially for the guy in the foreground. Nice compositio.', '2009-02-08 00:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244634, 760835, 103375, '<td valign="top">Hopefully you shot that with your long(er) lens. Very interesting. Phenomenal detail</td>', 'Hopefully you shot that with your long(er) lens. Very interesting. Phenomenal detail', '2009-02-08 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244638, 760903, 103375, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Perfect focal point. depth of field is a little too shallow. tighten up your aperture to keep the entire flower in focus yet still blur the background</td>', 'Nice composition. Perfect focal point. depth of field is a little too shallow. tighten up your aperture to keep the entire flower in focus yet still blur the background', '2009-02-08 00:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244803, 762548, 96915, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of the hand and the narrow depth of field, but even a narrow depth of field can''t help that competing background.  This would have been a more striking image if it had a plainer background, yet something that still conveys that it''s a home gym (such as a lamp?)</td>', 'I like the sharpness of the hand and the narrow depth of field, but even a narrow depth of field can''t help that competing background.  This would have been a more striking image if it had a plainer background, yet something that still conveys that it''s a home gym (such as a lamp?)', '2009-02-08 02:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244810, 762229, 96915, '<td valign="top">I''m not really seeing the connection to the challenge theme</td>', 'I''m not really seeing the connection to the challenge theme', '2009-02-08 02:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244867, 762605, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice morning colors.  Nice composition.  This evokes a "new day..."</td>', 'Nice morning colors.  Nice composition.  This evokes a "new day..."', '2009-02-08 03:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244871, 760536, 103032, '<td valign="top">Hilarious, how did you get that pose... a 9 for making me laugh...</td>', 'Hilarious, how did you get that pose... a 9 for making me laugh...', '2009-02-08 03:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244875, 760951, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the image, does make me think that it''s the beginning of the day, but the crop on the right was odd..</td>', 'I like the image, does make me think that it''s the beginning of the day, but the crop on the right was odd..', '2009-02-08 03:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244983, 762488, 44882, '<td valign="top">Stylish !</td>', 'Stylish !', '2009-02-08 08:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244984, 762389, 44882, '<td valign="top">I love the pose, Blue Ribbon !!!</td>', 'I love the pose, Blue Ribbon !!!', '2009-02-08 08:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244985, 762083, 44882, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF, well framed, good levels, a shared idea - the best realisation in this challenge.</td>', 'Perfect DOF, well framed, good levels, a shared idea - the best realisation in this challenge.', '2009-02-08 08:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244986, 762578, 44882, '<td valign="top">Clean and stylish, the shadow is perfect, well done.</td>', 'Clean and stylish, the shadow is perfect, well done.', '2009-02-08 08:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244988, 762430, 44882, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, the colors - best egg in this challenge, top 5 finish !</td>', 'I like the angle, the colors - best egg in this challenge, top 5 finish !', '2009-02-08 08:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5244991, 762548, 44882, '<td valign="top">I like the models expression, the focus on the hand, the DOF. Well done and a unique idea for the challenge. In my top 5.</td>', 'I like the models expression, the focus on the hand, the DOF. Well done and a unique idea for the challenge. In my top 5.', '2009-02-08 08:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5245411, 761601, 99695, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I think it would help if there was a light from the right to see the shadows of the pieces, if it was shot from a higher angle and with a little more depth of field.</td>', 'Nice idea. I think it would help if there was a light from the right to see the shadows of the pieces, if it was shot from a higher angle and with a little more depth of field.', '2009-02-08 15:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5245508, 762203, 52472, '<td valign="top">This is great. Nice theme, clever choice of focus and an optimal background.</td>', 'This is great. Nice theme, clever choice of focus and an optimal background.', '2009-02-08 17:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5245522, 762638, 52472, '<td valign="top">First it gives a strong stock photo feeling. But then, the processing of the washing line is very creative. A lovely 10!</td>', 'First it gives a strong stock photo feeling. But then, the processing of the washing line is very creative. A lovely 10!', '2009-02-08 17:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5245537, 762389, 52472, '<td valign="top">Technically perfect, creative, funny... That''s how modern wedding photography should be! A pitty there are not more like you around...</td>', 'Technically perfect, creative, funny... That''s how modern wedding photography should be! A pitty there are not more like you around...', '2009-02-08 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1);
