(5249234, 762530, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and nicely shot.</td>', 'Good DOF and nicely shot.', '2009-02-10 20:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249235, 761247, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good capture.</td>', 'Good capture.', '2009-02-10 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249251, 760779, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well, i like the use of light and the idea of using a egg, despite being a little obvious. I just think that the right part is too dark, there are distracting areas at the left, probably because of the background. I think that the cropping may take some point of you too, i think you could have shown all the egg. I know is not easy to get a perfect black background, when i tryed didn''t have much succes but with some PP and a better light only on the object i''m sure you will have a better shot.<br/>Good luck, sorry if i was rude!</td>', 'Well, i like the use of light and the idea of using a egg, despite being a little obvious. I just think that the right part is too dark, there are distracting areas at the left, probably because of the background. I think that the cropping may take some point of you too, i think you could have shown all the egg. I know is not easy to get a perfect black background, when i tryed didn''t have much succes but with some PP and a better light only on the object i''m sure you will have a better shot.Good luck, sorry if i was rude!', '2009-02-10 21:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249262, 760545, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well, i''m sorry but i don''t like this effect...I''m seeing photos on a notebook but your shot looks really grainy, and the silhouettes are kind of confusing, are those only trees? I think it doesn''t meet the challenge too.<br/>I think you had a good intention, and maybe a different perspective, a good time of exposion and less ISO would help you. I''m sorry but i will give you a 1.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Well, i''m sorry but i don''t like this effect...I''m seeing photos on a notebook but your shot looks really grainy, and the silhouettes are kind of confusing, are those only trees? I think it doesn''t meet the challenge too.I think you had a good intention, and maybe a different perspective, a good time of exposion and less ISO would help you. I''m sorry but i will give you a 1.Good luck.', '2009-02-10 21:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249269, 762624, 61641, '<td valign="top">Those fingernails!  Uggh.</td>', 'Those fingernails!  Uggh.', '2009-02-10 21:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249270, 762377, 61641, '<td valign="top">Looks like you put some time into this!  Nice</td>', 'Looks like you put some time into this!  Nice', '2009-02-10 21:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249278, 760508, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the moment you caught. I just think the colors could be better and the perspective too, i think it is a DNMC and it looks too much like a snapshot. I will give you a 2, but i think you really have a good catch of moment there. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!</td>', 'I like the idea and the moment you caught. I just think the colors could be better and the perspective too, i think it is a DNMC and it looks too much like a snapshot. I will give you a 2, but i think you really have a good catch of moment there. Sorry if i was rude! Good luck!', '2009-02-10 21:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249304, 762354, 99981, '<td valign="top">Aw! I can''t tell if it really meets the challenge, despite your tittle explain it. But it''s the only problem with this shot in my opinion, because i loved, really loved the light and this background...Some people may not like it because it''s "just" a sculpture, but it looks alive, which makes your shot look better!</td>', 'Aw! I can''t tell if it really meets the challenge, despite your tittle explain it. But it''s the only problem with this shot in my opinion, because i loved, really loved the light and this background...Some people may not like it because it''s "just" a sculpture, but it looks alive, which makes your shot look better!', '2009-02-10 21:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5249324, 762454, 99981, '<td valign="top">Giving you some points for your taste in music. Nice color on the upper part too.</td>', 'Giving you some points for your taste in music. Nice color on the upper part too.', '2009-02-10 21:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
