(5249397, 761002, 99981, '<td valign="top">Woa! Amazing details, great bokeh background and beautiful colors! It just don''t meet the challenge so much in my opinion but i can''t give a low vote on this shot. I will not give you a very high score too..but i''m picking it as a favorite! Superb!</td>', 'Woa! Amazing details, great bokeh background and beautiful colors! It just don''t meet the challenge so much in my opinion but i can''t give a low vote on this shot. I will not give you a very high score too..but i''m picking it as a favorite! Superb!', '2009-02-10 21:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
