(5249539, 762073, 100106, '<td valign="top">IMO - this is the best photo in the challenge. Nothing better describes (for me) the begining of a morning like she does. Love how you chose to focus on the symbol and not the whole cup. Also really like how the rest of the photo is empty. Really brings out the subject. Nicely done. 10</td>', 'IMO - this is the best photo in the challenge. Nothing better describes (for me) the begining of a morning like she does. Love how you chose to focus on the symbol and not the whole cup. Also really like how the rest of the photo is empty. Really brings out the subject. Nicely done. 10', '2009-02-10 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
