(5249574, 761871, 101849, '<td valign="top">Wow I can''t beleive it. Just got into this whole SLR thing a month ago. Top Ten on my 4th submission. Thank you all for the wonderful comments. <br/> <br/>Next stop hopefully a ribbon one day.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-11 00:16:09.</i></td>', 'Wow I can''t beleive it. Just got into this whole SLR thing a month ago. Top Ten on my 4th submission. Thank you all for the wonderful comments.  Next stop hopefully a ribbon one day.', '2009-02-11 00:15:04.000000', '2009-02-11 00:16:09.000000', 0),
(5249602, 762599, 23002, '<td valign="top">Way to go Peter!  Congrats on a well deserved ribbon. :)</td>', 'Way to go Peter!  Congrats on a well deserved ribbon. :)', '2009-02-11 00:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5249604, 761871, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and congratulations on top 10 so quickly.  It took me about 90 challenges.  I love the perspective.  I thought this might be the Capilano bridge.  You can''t see the height of it here.  I drove by it when we went to Vancouver but I heard the Lynn Canyon suspension bridge had a lot less people and was free, so we went there instead.  I have almost the same picture of it with my wife in the middle of it.</td>', 'Great shot, and congratulations on top 10 so quickly.  It took me about 90 challenges.  I love the perspective.  I thought this might be the Capilano bridge.  You can''t see the height of it here.  I drove by it when we went to Vancouver but I heard the Lynn Canyon suspension bridge had a lot less people and was free, so we went there instead.  I have almost the same picture of it with my wife in the middle of it.', '2009-02-11 00:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5249625, 761873, 102024, '<td valign="top">By the way, I was one of your 8''s because I loved the humor here.  =)</td>', 'By the way, I was one of your 8''s because I loved the humor here.  =)', '2009-02-11 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 0),
