(5250637, 762640, 103427, '<td valign="top">Hmm..I suppose some readers don''t know the Bible. In the beginning there was The Word. The earth was created out of void and darkness, and this looked a bit like a void or deep dungeon to me. The light and the bare tree branch is the representation of what''s to come - the cross, sacrifice and redemption. But all in all it represents beauty in the midst of darkness and hardship. Tough audience this time. Gee.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-15 18:59:22.</i></td>', 'Hmm..I suppose some readers don''t know the Bible. In the beginning there was The Word. The earth was created out of void and darkness, and this looked a bit like a void or deep dungeon to me. The light and the bare tree branch is the representation of what''s to come - the cross, sacrifice and redemption. But all in all it represents beauty in the midst of darkness and hardship. Tough audience this time. Gee.', '2009-02-11 11:16:44.000000', '2009-02-15 18:59:22.000000', 0),
